{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21841","headline":"恨妆成 · 元稹","name":"恨妆成","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓日穿隙明，开帷理妆点。\n傅粉贵重重，施朱怜冉冉。\n柔鬟背额垂，丛鬓随钗敛。\n凝翠晕蛾眉，轻红拂花脸。\n满头行小梳，当面施圆靥。\n最恨落花时，妆成独披掩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21841.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21841","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}